OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be
OL,6,Fcloudy through the evening and
OL,7,Fovernight with a few outbreaks of
OL,8,Flight rain and drizzle. Any rain
OL,9,Fmainly towards eastern coasts by the
OL,10,Fend of the night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FThe east will be mostly cloudy
OL,13,Fwith some outbreaks of light rain and
OL,14,Fdrizzle possible. Further west will be
OL,15,Fdry with bright and sunny intervals
OL,16,Fdeveloping later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
